WEBVTT

00:58.150 --> 00:59.450
HARÉ+GUU

01:00.490 --> 01:03.390
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:03.990 --> 01:07.020
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:07.700 --> 01:10.600
The passion, the way it was born

01:11.200 --> 01:14.170
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:14.800 --> 01:17.930
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

01:18.410 --> 01:21.400
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

01:22.010 --> 01:25.100
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

01:25.610 --> 01:28.280
Tonight, I want to see something scary

01:29.150 --> 01:31.249
Don't be afraid

01:31.250 --> 01:32.719
Going from one push after another

01:32.720 --> 01:34.819
The surprising feeling is nice

01:34.820 --> 01:36.519
And you end up dancing till morning

01:36.520 --> 01:38.459
LOVE LOVE LOVE

01:38.460 --> 01:41.830
TROPICANA

01:43.600 --> 01:46.690
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

01:47.370 --> 01:50.630
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

01:50.940 --> 01:53.970
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:54.540 --> 01:57.880
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:58.380 --> 02:01.250
Fall in love, boys and girls

02:01.820 --> 02:04.880
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

02:05.320 --> 02:08.410
The passion, the way it was born

02:09.020 --> 02:11.360
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

02:11.660 --> 02:15.299
HARÉ+GUU

02:15.300 --> 02:18.230
Beginning - Beginning

02:32.550 --> 02:34.310
Namu Amida

02:43.730 --> 02:45.590
Namu Amida

02:46.290 --> 02:48.560
Haré, are you back?

02:54.200 --> 02:56.800
If you're here, then run an errand for me.

02:58.640 --> 03:01.010
What? You're playing games again?
Hey now...

03:01.080 --> 03:02.080
I'm home.

03:02.340 --> 03:04.330
Didn't you have a half-day today?

03:05.280 --> 03:06.280
All this time...

03:13.020 --> 03:15.110
You're fighting the boss right now.

03:16.690 --> 03:18.630
The last time you saved...

03:20.230 --> 03:21.230
was when?

03:22.460 --> 03:24.290
T-Today...

03:26.270 --> 03:27.270
Not yet.

03:37.580 --> 03:38.600
It's over...

03:39.050 --> 03:40.540
Everything is over...

03:42.250 --> 03:43.810
I'll leave the errand in your hands.

03:51.230 --> 03:52.450
What am I?

03:59.530 --> 04:00.530
Hii!

04:01.540 --> 04:04.060
Hold on. I'll feed you when I get back.

04:16.880 --> 04:18.040
Oh, it's just a pokute.

04:23.190 --> 04:26.559
I should have just gone back before
entering that dungeon and saved!

04:26.560 --> 04:30.129
But, who'd have imagined that you'd end up
straight at the boss battle from there?

04:30.130 --> 04:32.090
Oh, the person who made the game
is such an idiot!

04:32.130 --> 04:33.330
But, I'm an idiot, too!

04:34.840 --> 04:36.469
I knew it was a little
strange from the onset...

04:36.470 --> 04:37.909
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

04:37.910 --> 04:39.630
Heh.
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

04:43.480 --> 04:44.810
Oh, it's just a pokute...

05:03.160 --> 05:05.330
Oh, that's right. Bananas, bananas.

05:07.840 --> 05:10.270
nine, ten. All right that's ten.

05:18.750 --> 05:19.750
Po-kute...?

05:50.880 --> 05:53.610
Oh, it's all right, let him play his game.

05:53.780 --> 05:55.210
But he's such a monkey about it.

05:55.980 --> 05:57.310
Time passes so quickly.

05:57.420 --> 06:00.010
How long has it been since you've started
living here, Weda?

06:00.660 --> 06:01.860
Has it been ten years already?

06:02.190 --> 06:05.680
When you start talking about memories,
it shows that you've aged, Rebecca.

06:06.130 --> 06:07.190
Well, excuse me!

06:10.970 --> 06:13.490
So bold of him! The sun is still up!

06:14.270 --> 06:15.460
He's like his father.

06:17.110 --> 06:18.110
Where are the bananas?

06:18.140 --> 06:19.070
Before that!

06:19.071 --> 06:21.039
There was a huge monster
in the banana field!

06:21.040 --> 06:22.270
I was eaten alive!

06:22.340 --> 06:23.340
But you're here.

06:23.480 --> 06:25.609
I really don't know why myself!

06:25.610 --> 06:26.979
But it's really, really true!

06:26.980 --> 06:29.180
It went "Bafu! Bafu!" Like, "Bafu!"

06:31.220 --> 06:32.220
Oh, I see.

06:34.190 --> 06:37.929
Attention all villagers. We have a meeting
now concerning the hunt tomorrow.

06:37.930 --> 06:39.250
Please gather at the main square.

06:41.630 --> 06:42.490
Weda, it's about time.

06:42.560 --> 06:43.150
You're right...

06:43.330 --> 06:45.429
Haré, peel and boil these for me.

06:45.430 --> 06:46.660
Don't forget the salt.

06:47.030 --> 06:48.910
And you can't eat them
until I get back, either.

06:49.000 --> 06:49.490
Demon.

06:49.570 --> 06:50.200
See ya!

06:50.270 --> 06:51.100
Mom!

06:51.210 --> 06:53.730
Don't leave me alone here!
That thing is coming!

06:54.240 --> 06:55.240
Haré...

06:56.740 --> 06:57.770
I understand.

06:57.910 --> 06:58.910
Mom...

06:59.350 --> 07:01.940
Haré, that's a distant dream...

07:02.020 --> 07:04.420
A dream you had that was sweet and sad.

07:04.590 --> 07:06.180
It's a memory of the distant past.

07:07.860 --> 07:10.219
Mom, just because you don't want to be
troubled... making something up like that...

07:10.220 --> 07:11.820
If you're too persistent...

07:15.230 --> 07:16.230
you're going down.

07:18.600 --> 07:19.760
I'm done.

07:32.510 --> 07:33.480
No, no, no, no.

07:33.481 --> 07:35.241
There can't really be
anything of that sort.

07:35.420 --> 07:36.680
It really is a dream after all.

07:36.750 --> 07:37.750
Yup.

07:40.320 --> 07:41.489
No, no, no, no, no!

07:41.490 --> 07:42.889
A dream! I'm saying it's a dream!

07:42.890 --> 07:44.620
A dream. I'm scared of a dream.

07:56.570 --> 07:59.010
I'm home!

08:00.410 --> 08:02.240
Oh no! Someone needs to answer me!

08:02.480 --> 08:05.649
You know Haré, Mom is in a really good
mood right now.

08:05.650 --> 08:06.480
Can you guess why?

08:06.550 --> 08:07.170
You've been drinking.

08:07.320 --> 08:08.180
Mmm, close.

08:08.250 --> 08:12.419
That's definitely a reason,
or rather, one of the reasons.

08:12.420 --> 08:12.890
Huh?

08:13.320 --> 08:15.050
All right! Everyone, everyone listen up!

08:15.120 --> 08:17.920
Today I'm going to introduce
you to a new friend!

08:17.990 --> 08:18.660
What?

08:18.661 --> 08:20.180
Guu-chan, come on in!

08:20.960 --> 08:21.960
Are you serious?

08:26.470 --> 08:27.630
Good evening.

08:30.510 --> 08:32.170
Good evening.

08:33.540 --> 08:36.170
Oh, it's not like you to be blushing, Haré.

08:36.240 --> 08:37.240
Haré?

08:37.310 --> 08:38.680
Yeah! My name is Haré.

08:39.050 --> 08:41.640
Haré... Nice to meet you.

08:43.890 --> 08:47.359
Guu-chan doesn't have a father or a mother.

08:47.360 --> 08:49.950
So I thought it'd be nice
for her to live with us.

08:50.020 --> 08:51.890
You say that so suddenly...

08:55.830 --> 08:57.560
That's why you need to get along with her!

09:02.400 --> 09:04.930
Oh no, it's the slave farm!

09:08.210 --> 09:09.339
One, two, three.

09:09.340 --> 09:10.549
Oh, I'm done.

09:10.550 --> 09:12.340
I'm so happy! I'm a millionaire!

09:12.580 --> 09:13.949
Oh man, I lost.

09:13.950 --> 09:14.650
This makes us tied at one apiece.
Oh man, I lost.

09:14.651 --> 09:15.971
This makes us tied at one apiece.

09:18.420 --> 09:20.510
She's such a mysterious girl...

09:21.490 --> 09:25.189
White skin, a face unfamiliar to this land.

09:25.190 --> 09:27.630
She sure has a cute smile.

09:28.900 --> 09:31.020
And her eyes are frighteningly pretty...

09:31.300 --> 09:33.740
Just looking at them makes me think
I'm going to be sucked in.

09:35.470 --> 09:37.900
Now, now, enough of the partying.
We're going to sleep now.

09:38.070 --> 09:39.070
Okay!

09:49.880 --> 09:52.110
I hope I can be friends with her...

09:53.790 --> 09:56.220
HARÉ+GUU

09:59.590 --> 10:02.590
Haré! Haré! Wake up!

10:05.900 --> 10:06.900
Huh?

10:07.800 --> 10:09.360
You got some bananas?

10:09.640 --> 10:11.900
Yeah. Guu got me some yesterday.

10:13.410 --> 10:14.410
Yesterday?

10:15.010 --> 10:16.530
Did you say good morning to Guu?

10:17.410 --> 10:18.410
Good morning!

10:19.550 --> 10:20.550
Good morning.

10:30.460 --> 10:32.150
What's wrong with you?

10:32.260 --> 10:35.250
W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-Who is that girl?

10:35.400 --> 10:36.400
Huh?

10:36.460 --> 10:37.469
What do you mean "who"?

10:37.470 --> 10:38.800
It's Guu-chan! Right?

10:38.870 --> 10:39.630
It's not the same!

10:39.631 --> 10:42.216
It's a completely different person!
Or rather, a completely different creature!

10:42.240 --> 10:43.900
Don't be so rude.

10:43.970 --> 10:44.810
How is she so different?

10:44.810 --> 10:45.540
But she looks different from yesterday.
How is she so different?

10:45.540 --> 10:45.940
But she looks different from yesterday.

10:45.940 --> 10:46.410
But she looks different from yesterday.
I mean...

10:46.410 --> 10:46.740
I mean...

10:46.741 --> 10:49.180
What was Guu-chan like the way you
remember?

10:49.240 --> 10:50.300
Explain in detail.

10:50.780 --> 10:51.800
W-Well...

10:51.880 --> 10:55.210
White skin, really thin,
and a face unfamiliar in this area...

10:55.320 --> 10:58.580
White skin, really thin,
and a face unfamiliar in this area.

10:58.850 --> 11:00.389
See, it is Guu-chan!

11:00.390 --> 11:00.620
She looks nothing like it!
See, it is Guu-chan!

11:00.620 --> 11:01.380
She looks nothing like it!

11:01.460 --> 11:03.220
Well, women tend to change.

11:03.290 --> 11:05.160
You can't change that much in one day!

11:05.260 --> 11:07.706
If you're so worried about the
petty details, you'll never be a man!

11:07.730 --> 11:09.290
It's not a petty detail!

11:09.660 --> 11:11.720
If you're too persistent...

11:11.930 --> 11:13.230
You're taking me down?

11:16.640 --> 11:18.000
I'll send you up to heaven.

11:21.680 --> 11:22.800
Attention everyone.

11:22.880 --> 11:24.479
We will go through with the hunt today as
originally scheduled.
Well, mom has to go work now.

11:24.480 --> 11:24.950
We will go through with the hunt today as
originally scheduled.

11:24.951 --> 11:26.779
We will go through with the hunt today as
originally scheduled.
Haré, why don't you take Guu-chan around
and show her the village?

11:26.780 --> 11:27.956
Haré, why don't you take Guu-chan around
and show her the village?

11:27.980 --> 11:29.680
Why loose socks for work?

11:29.880 --> 11:30.650
That's not the point!

11:30.790 --> 11:32.780
Guu-chan, be nice to my little Haré, okay?

11:32.850 --> 11:34.080
I'll be going now! Kiss?

11:34.160 --> 11:35.990
No! I don't want to be all alone with her!

11:36.190 --> 11:38.320
I'll be back by dusk, so be a good boy.

11:38.530 --> 11:40.050
Don't be playing games all day!

11:41.100 --> 11:42.120
Mom!

11:42.430 --> 11:45.090
Don't go!

11:53.710 --> 11:55.700
Is a banana that strange?

11:56.180 --> 11:57.800
But Guu was the one that brought them...

12:00.050 --> 12:01.410
You like bananas?

12:13.790 --> 12:16.730
We're already to the point where we can't
hold a conversation!

12:17.230 --> 12:18.230
What should I do?

12:22.000 --> 12:23.000
All right!

12:23.900 --> 12:25.800
Oh, that's called a banana.

12:25.870 --> 12:28.100
You take it and peel it
like this before you eat...

12:29.840 --> 12:31.280
Help me!

12:35.050 --> 12:36.050
Tastes awful.

12:37.520 --> 12:40.510
What was that sound, that scream?

12:41.720 --> 12:43.820
And yet, nothing happened to the banana.

12:45.130 --> 12:47.360
It's not like she's causing any harm...

12:47.500 --> 12:48.580
Oh well, I guess it's okay.

12:48.900 --> 12:50.160
Hey, do you want to go outside?

12:50.260 --> 12:51.260
To do what?

12:52.730 --> 12:54.030
I mean, a tour of the village.

12:54.300 --> 12:55.630
What's a village?

12:56.470 --> 12:58.170
I mean, here. What's around our house.

12:58.270 --> 12:59.710
What's a tour?

13:00.140 --> 13:02.510
To teach what is where!

13:02.680 --> 13:03.730
What's teach?

13:03.840 --> 13:05.409
It's all right if you don't want to!

13:05.410 --> 13:07.090
I'm going through the trouble of offering!

13:07.410 --> 13:10.849
Guu-chan doesn't have a father or a mother,

13:10.850 --> 13:12.530
So, you guys should be nice to each other,

13:12.850 --> 13:15.450
I'm sorry, I...

13:15.660 --> 13:17.820
Might as well... I'll have you teach me.

13:18.530 --> 13:19.530
Sure!

13:19.690 --> 13:22.530
If you go straight down this road,
you end up at the town square.

13:23.830 --> 13:25.729
And if you turn here, the school.

13:25.730 --> 13:27.450
It's small, but it's got a good atmosphere.

13:28.100 --> 13:29.870
Oh, it's a manda. We're so lucky!

13:32.540 --> 13:33.230
Here.

13:33.510 --> 13:35.240
These things are delicious!

13:35.980 --> 13:38.340
Oh, be careful, the jam will
spurt out if you push too hard.

13:45.750 --> 13:46.830
You're not going to eat it?

13:49.560 --> 13:50.560
Hii!

13:55.260 --> 13:56.260
Hii?

13:56.330 --> 13:58.700
Yeah, I feed it every so often.

13:58.770 --> 14:00.260
It likes me the most.

14:10.780 --> 14:12.010
Oh, a bird!

14:16.350 --> 14:19.150
I see, but she's going
to spit it out again.

14:24.830 --> 14:25.830
Tastes awful.

14:28.600 --> 14:29.600
Hii!

14:30.160 --> 14:31.690
My cute little Hii!

14:33.070 --> 14:35.870
Hii! I... I...

14:37.170 --> 14:44.170
I'm more worried about the voice
that said "Oh, a bird!" from inside
Guu's mouth than about your death!

14:50.580 --> 14:52.980
Forgive me for being this way, Hii.

14:56.120 --> 14:59.150
That's true... I have
to think more positively.

15:00.190 --> 15:02.130
Hii, it's not that you're dead.

15:02.200 --> 15:04.820
You'll live on in Guu's body.

15:05.070 --> 15:07.830
That way, I can become
better friends with Guu.

15:08.070 --> 15:11.000
I'm sure it's just to me that
her face is different from yesterday.

15:11.270 --> 15:12.170
That must be it!

15:12.240 --> 15:16.370
I must have been seeing Guu's inner beauty
within her smile last night.

15:16.440 --> 15:17.970
It's not that I was tricked.

15:18.180 --> 15:18.970
As proof...

15:19.050 --> 15:21.170
Hey, can you give me a nice smile?

15:24.050 --> 15:26.380
I really was fooled after all...

15:26.750 --> 15:28.750
Haré, you're up early.

15:29.090 --> 15:30.090
Morning, Rebec...

15:30.091 --> 15:31.460
Oh, Guu-chan, right?

15:31.530 --> 15:32.250
You're Guu-chan, right?

15:32.330 --> 15:33.859
I heard about you from Weda.

15:33.860 --> 15:34.860
I'm Rebecca.

15:34.861 --> 15:36.350
I'm your "big sister" from next door.

15:36.830 --> 15:39.590
You're so cute! Doesn't everyone say that?

15:39.670 --> 15:41.390
She's just saying that because it's polite.

15:41.500 --> 15:43.400
T-That's not the case, really.

15:43.740 --> 15:45.100
Everyone's just being reserved.

15:45.340 --> 15:46.700
Well, I'll be on my way now.

15:46.770 --> 15:47.830
Oh, see you later.

15:47.910 --> 15:48.640
See ya.

15:48.780 --> 15:50.400
Goodbye!

15:54.080 --> 15:55.080
Hey...

15:55.820 --> 15:57.370
Why do you change your face like that?

15:57.920 --> 15:58.920
Face?

16:02.420 --> 16:03.890
Yes, that's it! That!

16:04.020 --> 16:05.460
If I have to put it in words...

16:05.730 --> 16:07.220
Maybe it's a habit?

16:07.660 --> 16:08.660
Oh, I see.

16:08.760 --> 16:11.030
I'm tired. Let's go home and play games.

16:14.070 --> 16:15.599
Don't do something so meaningless!

16:15.600 --> 16:17.360
That's enough!
Turn your face back to normal!

16:18.040 --> 16:19.560
But I don't like that either.

16:29.350 --> 16:30.350
What?

16:30.520 --> 16:31.520
What?

16:31.850 --> 16:33.340
Is the TV so unusual?

16:36.360 --> 16:37.360
Don't eat it.

16:38.260 --> 16:38.720
Damn.

16:38.990 --> 16:40.620
What do you mean, "Damn"? Was I right?

16:41.760 --> 16:42.850
Are you serious?

16:43.100 --> 16:44.100
Huh?

16:44.130 --> 16:45.130
The TV.

16:46.470 --> 16:47.710
Are you really going to eat it?

16:47.900 --> 16:48.900
I guess.

16:49.100 --> 16:51.500
Aah! What do you mean by "I guess"?

16:51.640 --> 16:55.200
Abstract words like that,
something that shows indecision
hurts other people the most!

16:58.580 --> 17:00.270
Oh, all right! Swallow the TV!

17:00.380 --> 17:02.910
But, after you do,
spit it back out, just like that banana!

17:03.920 --> 17:04.920
What about Hii?

17:05.020 --> 17:06.750
Eh? You're going to bring Hii back out?

17:06.820 --> 17:07.720
So it's alive after all?

17:07.720 --> 17:08.380
Yup.

17:08.460 --> 17:09.666
Out with it! Spit it out right now!

17:09.690 --> 17:11.020
Can't.

17:11.090 --> 17:11.720
Why not?

17:11.830 --> 17:12.880
She likes it.

17:12.990 --> 17:13.990
You do?

17:15.130 --> 17:16.130
Not me.

17:17.430 --> 17:18.160
"Bafu"?

17:18.430 --> 17:20.400
This is the sound I heard in the banana
field...

17:20.930 --> 17:22.530
But anyway, where is this?

17:26.440 --> 17:27.440
Guu!

17:27.640 --> 17:29.610
Aren't you here, Guu?

17:30.080 --> 17:31.310
Hey!

17:32.050 --> 17:33.780
Guu!

17:34.050 --> 17:35.540
HEY!

17:41.360 --> 17:43.220
What happened to me?

17:44.290 --> 17:46.690
I have no idea what's going on here...

17:47.360 --> 17:48.520
I've had enough...

17:54.470 --> 17:55.630
Hii!

18:17.460 --> 18:18.760
I'm sorry, Haré-kun.

18:20.190 --> 18:23.220
She's not letting this one go
because I took a fancy to it.

18:23.400 --> 18:25.160
Not letting it go? Who won't?

18:25.530 --> 18:26.690
I'm really sorry.

18:27.000 --> 18:28.446
I-I-I-I have no idea
what you're talking about!

18:28.470 --> 18:29.770
Besides, who are you?

18:29.840 --> 18:31.069
Why do you know my name?

18:31.070 --> 18:31.310
Yo!
Why do you know my name?

18:31.310 --> 18:32.310
Yo!

18:32.670 --> 18:34.160
Haré, we meet again.

18:34.240 --> 18:35.240
Have you been doing well?

18:35.740 --> 18:36.800
Who are you two?

18:37.180 --> 18:39.810
What, he doesn't remember
anything about us?

18:39.950 --> 18:40.950
Looks that way.

18:45.490 --> 18:47.750
What, after we made such passionate love?

18:47.820 --> 18:48.380
What?

18:48.620 --> 18:49.820
Don't be telling lies.

18:50.160 --> 18:51.990
I'll re-introduce myself.

18:52.230 --> 18:55.220
I'm Mamou Tomoyo, 18 years old.
I'm a housekeeper.

18:55.330 --> 19:00.290
And I'm Tachibana Seiichi, a senior at the
famous prep school, Kamikita High School.
Class #2, roll call #12.

19:00.370 --> 19:01.370
And...

19:01.670 --> 19:03.446
Dress Code Disciplinary Committee
I'm the vice-chair of the school dress code
committee.

19:03.470 --> 19:07.000
Seiichi-kun, you know, I've been meaning to
tell you this from a while back...

19:07.070 --> 19:08.200
Yes, what is it?

19:08.280 --> 19:11.400
Why don't you stop showing off that
armband each time you meet someone?

19:11.550 --> 19:13.010
Oh, it's alright if I do, isn't it?

19:13.110 --> 19:15.480
It just sounds like you're bragging.

19:15.750 --> 19:17.550
That's not the case at all.

19:17.620 --> 19:18.520
Oh, I see.

19:18.590 --> 19:19.520
Hmmm?

19:19.590 --> 19:20.780
What do you mean "Hmmm"?

19:20.850 --> 19:22.196
Something about that gets to me...

19:22.220 --> 19:24.590
No, really, I don't mean
to be bragging at all!

19:24.660 --> 19:25.660
Oh well, it's alright.

19:25.760 --> 19:27.090
Can I ask one thing?

19:28.600 --> 19:29.690
Where is this?

19:29.960 --> 19:31.560
Inside her stomach.

19:32.230 --> 19:33.230
Her?

19:34.400 --> 19:36.770
You were calling her by a name in the
outside world.

19:37.070 --> 19:37.700
Guu.

19:37.870 --> 19:39.500
GUU!?

19:47.010 --> 19:48.680
What a stupid dream.

19:49.080 --> 19:52.450
Well, it was unusually realistic
for a dream... Just kidding.

19:55.160 --> 19:57.650
Guu, you should sleep on the futon...

20:01.730 --> 20:02.730
Guu?

20:04.900 --> 20:08.140
She's sleeping with her eyes half open.
There are people like this every so often.

20:08.300 --> 20:10.070
Yup, yup, there sure are.

20:10.140 --> 20:11.230
Well, sleep tight.

20:11.310 --> 20:13.591
Since I can't carry you,
I'll cover you up with a blanket.

20:15.110 --> 20:18.270
Why am I speaking each and every
thing I do out loud?

20:22.320 --> 20:23.379
Hey!

20:23.380 --> 20:24.850
Haré, you were able to get back out!

20:24.920 --> 20:25.940
Come visit again!

20:26.450 --> 20:28.510
Hey, does Hii do any tricks?

20:28.590 --> 20:29.780
Can I teach it a few things?

20:30.060 --> 20:31.990
You don't need an
appointment to come see us!

20:32.060 --> 20:33.080
See you later!

20:34.090 --> 20:35.430
So in other words...

20:36.030 --> 20:40.699
The fact that those two and Hii
are inside Guu's eyes means
that was real and not a dream.

20:40.700 --> 20:43.499
And I was inside Guu's stomach
until a few minutes ago.

20:43.500 --> 20:46.009
Which in turn means the "Bafu" I heard
was the sound of me being eaten.

20:46.010 --> 20:49.039
And, the one back in the banana field
is the same sound I heard
so it was when I was eaten.

20:49.040 --> 20:52.400
And that means that the big monster
I saw in the banana field...
Can it be? Can it be?

20:52.950 --> 20:55.070
So that's what it's all about!

20:55.220 --> 20:59.080
But I don't want that!!!

21:12.300 --> 21:13.530
I'm home!

21:14.200 --> 21:15.930
Here! A souvenir!

21:16.840 --> 21:19.100
In other words, a dream. It's all a dream.

21:24.410 --> 21:25.610
What are you doing?

22:36.250 --> 22:37.150
NEXT EPISODE

22:37.151 --> 22:39.849
Wow, what wonderful weather outside. I guess
I'll be my cheerful self as I go to school.

22:39.850 --> 22:40.790
Hm? Did you say something, Mom?

22:40.791 --> 22:43.019
What do you mean, a good sendoff?
Guu's coming to school with me!?

22:43.020 --> 22:44.359
NEXT EPISODE

22:44.360 --> 22:46.029
And what's with that god-awful outfit?

22:46.030 --> 22:47.889
That's more of a troublemaker
than a mood maker!

22:47.890 --> 22:50.359
And Guu, don't start off by
swallowing the teacher whole!

22:50.360 --> 22:52.469
Furthermore, we're starting with
a siesta during first period!?
What is the teacher thinking?

22:52.470 --> 22:54.429
Oh, and just as I thought,
Guu is flooded with questions...

22:54.430 --> 22:56.799
Hello? Guu?
What is that sign of anger on your fist?

22:56.800 --> 22:59.240
Hey, where did everyone go?
Can it be? That all of them?

22:59.670 --> 23:01.839
Next episode of Haré+Guu:

23:01.840 --> 23:02.909
"Siesta Guu Guu"

23:02.910 --> 23:03.080
Siesta Guu Guu

23:03.081 --> 23:04.849
Don't get anyone other
than me involved in all of this!

23:04.850 --> 23:06.049
He sure is a noisy one
